pan class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 替换为指定版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>replace github.com/pkg/errors v0.9.1 => github.com/pkg/errors v0.8.1</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>replace 方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本地开发调试</td>\n<td><code>=&gt; ../local-path</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fork 替代</td>\n<td><code>=&gt; github.com/fork/pkg v1.0.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本降级</td>\n<td><code>模块 v1.0 =&gt; 模块 v0.9</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有仓库映射</td>\n<td><code>公开路径 =&gt; 私有路径 版本</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"exclude-指令\">exclude 指令</h3><p><code>exclude</code> 用于排除已知有问题的版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"exclude (&#10;    github.com/pkg/lib v1.1.0  // 有已知 bug&#10;    github.com/pkg/lib v1.1.1  // 安全漏洞&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>exclude (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    github.com/pkg/lib v1.1.0  // 有已知 bug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    github.com/pkg/lib v1.1.1  // 安全漏洞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"vendor-模式\">Vendor 模式</h2><p>Vendor 模式将所有依赖复制到项目的 <code>vendor/</code> 目录中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"go mod vendor&#10;&#10;go build -mod=vendor ./...&#10;&#10;go env -w GOFLAGS=-mod=vendor\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vendor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -mod=vendor</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GOFLAGS=-mod=vendor</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Vendor 目录结构&quot;&#10;        V[vendor/]&#10;        V --&gt; MOD[modules.txt]&#10;        V --&gt; P1[github.com/gin-gonic/gin/]&#10;        V --&gt; P2[go.uber.org/zap/]&#10;        V --&gt; P3[golang.org/x/sync/]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Vendor 目录结构\"\n        V[vendor/]\n        V --&gt; MOD[modules.txt]\n        V --&gt; P1[github.com/gin-gonic/gin/]\n        V --&gt; P2[go.uber.org/zap/]\n        V --&gt; P3[golang.org/x/sync/]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否使用 Vendor</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开源项目</td>\n<td>通常不用，依赖可公开获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业项目</td>\n<td>推荐，确保离线构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI/CD</td>\n<td>推荐，加速构建、避免网络问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气隔离环境</td>\n<td>必须，无法访问外网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖审计严格</td>\n<td>推荐，所有代码可审查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"依赖审计\">依赖审计</h2><h3 id=\"go-mod-verify\">go mod verify</h3><p>验证本地缓存中的依赖是否与 go.sum 匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"go mod verify&#10;# all modules verified\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><